{"title":"Denim Sidewalls? Teravail Shows New Jorts-Inspired Tires & Prototype Stems at MADE","link":"https://bikerumor.com/denim-sidewalls-teravail-shows-new-jorts-inspired-tires-prototype-stems-at-made/","date":1787413763000,"content":"<p><img src=\"/media/b37f6ee75ce63edc8b005ee9f2da3489c44133581be80c939f60a8b4f4048c08.jpg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" alt=\"(Photos / Ron Frazelle)\" /></p>\n<p>Man, there is always a lot to see at MADE, including from component brands like <a href=\"https://www.teravail.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Teravail</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>It looks like they will be venturing further into offering <a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/teravail-launches-new-bars-grips-stems-dropper-posts-for-gravel-and-bikepacking/\" target=\"_blank\">cockpit options</a> with the release of two new stems. They also were showing some tires inspired by the jorts of MADE. Just kidding. But they do have a unique ‘denim’ finish…</p>\n\n\n\n<h2>Teravail Prototype Stems</h2>\n\n\n\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"/media/8a7d2626766d99833eb59398d156f356f7a855afbe5b0782ae18a7f1d7b1c8e7.jpg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" src=\"/media/8a7d2626766d99833eb59398d156f356f7a855afbe5b0782ae18a7f1d7b1c8e7.jpg\" alt=\"MADE Teravail Prototype Stems back side\" srcset=\"/media/8a7d2626766d99833eb59398d156f356f7a855afbe5b0782ae18a7f1d7b1c8e7.jpg 1280w, /media/11ed92273cdf1da3d5c658b82540e10d5027b8b7fd60dec6ca800756fde86210.jpg 297w, /media/37ad6cdf9bffb837c7126b8eb68c2c3ef1666c5d42f75265ce0d52f7703a60d1.jpg 120w, /media/dfb1f894facd4263bc6115b98ca1e0b8167f4f1c5204108a9ed34728b915a622.jpg 768w, /media/eb6d6f81209a54270831ec809787edc62db51590b7d866a982fc971f46cfbbc8.jpg 800w, /media/58e7095977b925556bd86a4d7abcdae354133f0e551050d603908e27c30ddaa4.jpg 720w\" /></a><figcaption>Traditional type</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"/media/b1f724ed89eff9fc3a78b7453303cc9b52d404e3a0125b15fb5a091109473a31.jpg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" src=\"/media/b1f724ed89eff9fc3a78b7453303cc9b52d404e3a0125b15fb5a091109473a31.jpg\" alt=\"MADE Teravail Prototype Stems side view top loader\" srcset=\"/media/b1f724ed89eff9fc3a78b7453303cc9b52d404e3a0125b15fb5a091109473a31.jpg 1280w, /media/b5b3a53d5a6a93e57b30b7ecdd76e1884ff23cb6613f4578f6f59a750ca9c3b5.jpg 297w, /media/0f884a50c3de49ee35798b7768b696af9740c1e10b4d53c89f20adc73d1ef8ac.jpg 120w, /media/c573d97e09e3dc1671455cd86246b58831207297b898519f5567f5589d32b375.jpg 768w, /media/a1e143bbdd7ef6f5f146bd9d813c2f9f804767de16562bc7d6ad71e7b4d2b094.jpg 800w, /media/04470826fe9648222e831e48832bde802970bac1f9bef594f3bcab7ee9cfbac5.jpg 720w\" /></a><figcaption>Top loader</figcaption></figure>\n<figcaption>(Photos / Ron Frazelle)</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>There were only two on display; there was one that was a more traditional type (above left), and one that was a top loader. I didn’t get any details; all the brand told me was that they are prototypes. So, we aren’t sure when they are coming, what lengths, colors, rises, or clamp size will be available.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"/media/31daab91110ee4dd63968f575f2acaca3e1b1f2368dd19428e987bcad9ca4f18.jpg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" src=\"/media/31daab91110ee4dd63968f575f2acaca3e1b1f2368dd19428e987bcad9ca4f18.jpg\" alt=\"MADE Teravail Prototype Stems Low key branding\" srcset=\"/media/31daab91110ee4dd63968f575f2acaca3e1b1f2368dd19428e987bcad9ca4f18.jpg 1280w, /media/afaf60710727f956870cdcbec756f643235758c930d07b72140aa48dd9048053.jpg 297w, /media/88cd1a9dbba733ab1f25cb749837235769c9e40af3e2b1bee3dec3cfdd46ca39.jpg 120w, /media/57bfa534b5d317e4015b69d57292f6e1189d79e9578a1c8d58ca0512c6181eef.jpg 768w, /media/247741e43bbc8e75d9b50b8bfa94c56285ce0fccf875857f72b6cd8d8354cc0b.jpg 800w, /media/991b08121c6a9c0964dfc2a0c1dbbfd89d5488e920b9ad5f7735f147e2532415.jpg 720w\" /></a><figcaption>Traditional type</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>But I thought it would be cool for you guys to see what they looked like. I will say, keeping to the brand’s way of doing things, they are simple and understated in the actual branding. I found the traditional-looking stem to be quite handsome. I’m looking forward to what becomes of these bits.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2>Black Wall, Tan Wall, or Denim Wall?</h2>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"/media/b37f6ee75ce63edc8b005ee9f2da3489c44133581be80c939f60a8b4f4048c08.jpg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" src=\"/media/b37f6ee75ce63edc8b005ee9f2da3489c44133581be80c939f60a8b4f4048c08.jpg\" alt=\"MADE Teravail Prototype Stems hot patch\" srcset=\"/media/b37f6ee75ce63edc8b005ee9f2da3489c44133581be80c939f60a8b4f4048c08.jpg 1280w, /media/12ada9e9e3e10b66d84091f0815eb11afc6a73db8fe42f0cedd9b7a82a36d993.jpg 297w, /media/6e17d5e719c4f3ec1d4426d6387b9e27079d938b63f400e09d9f39cebaf942ee.jpg 120w, /media/be82986cd6c1bf8f19c62d4dd9fbbf45c3cc6ac8ca41b2fc80234dbf41ad85da.jpg 768w, /media/f3d86071d9bed8de5daa1c2c3bd3e4a412c9d5abc312a345dee3bb63fef25a98.jpg 800w, /media/99513b7e79e315548f5ba85505c373ca49f0ff9e411fa4119f58943315082b2a.jpg 720w\" /></a><figcaption>(Photos / Ron Frazelle)</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>No. Not really. These are denim <em>printed </em>sidewalls. Teravail was excited to show me this tire. And I’m glad they did. I think it’s pretty cool-looking. As you can see, it really kinda looks like denim. I think it’s a cool change-up from the traditional sidewall colors. I could see it looking really neat on certain builds.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"/media/61cc145af246eea2425597e6adf9b6bc9761156b29903853ccb7c15efd0275e8.jpg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" src=\"/media/61cc145af246eea2425597e6adf9b6bc9761156b29903853ccb7c15efd0275e8.jpg\" alt=\"MADE Teravail Prototype Stems denim side walls\" srcset=\"/media/61cc145af246eea2425597e6adf9b6bc9761156b29903853ccb7c15efd0275e8.jpg 1280w, /media/ad193ceba8fc53da3937352c3820350f7f220d99c26f11a3f928ba91444c46dd.jpg 297w, /media/03e6d776886ed2c68ed241275a59d51508d527f8f4e7d3eaadd479f83e57720d.jpg 120w, /media/75b9c2840564a7a61173feb7b15aea8594f19304aa0afa8790ea62bb16e6fdf9.jpg 768w, /media/2ff96370f435d1160ac80a00a7107c652452414494d5ae840dbd6c11920a282f.jpg 800w, /media/b2345138d2a7cd3720427bb67b93e09f07cce08f363fce5820d389bac8d550b1.jpg 720w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Again, I have zero information for you, as the brand just wanted me to see it. And said I could take photos of it. Not sure if this is a prototype, or when/if it will be available. I don’t know what threads or sizes it will be available in either. Sorry, I just got to see it, hold it, and photograph it. I did like it and thought it would be really great for certain bike builds. </p>\n\n\n\n<p>Teravail crëw operates out of Minnesota and traveled a long way to be here supporting the independent frame builder (there were a lot of their tires and wheels on 32″ builds at the show, more on that soon) and show their new/upcoming stuff. Check out their selection of great tires and other cockpit goodies at the link below.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><em><a href=\"https://www.teravail.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Teravail.com</a></em></p>","author":"Ron Frazelle","comments":"https://bikerumor.com/denim-sidewalls-teravail-shows-new-jorts-inspired-tires-prototype-stems-at-made/#respond","siteTitle":"Bikerumor","siteHash":"49f427af0a926f4232eb837006841d7242e153e3afbb590f32e4b104ea3e2718","entryHash":"22d764b9646f9cfc14ca30a87a01ae82831a069357902cd2cf9201bb406b2b60","category":"Cycling"}